BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 306.02 Tm (Under a deliberately simplified binary model, expected contribution equals the probability of collecting the full $9,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 290.80 Tm (multiplied by $9,000, minus the certain $4,700 cost. Break-even collection probability is therefore $4,700 divided by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 275.57 Tm ($9,000, or approximately 52.2 percent, before overhead and the time value of money. At 70 percent assumed collection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 260.35 Tm (probability, expected contribution is $1,600, not $4,300. This sensitivity is a decision aid, not an empirically measured) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 245.12 Tm (success rate. Court reductions, partial distributions, record delays, disputes, and extra legal work create additional) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 229.90 Tm (outcomes that the binary model omits. Replace hypothetical probabilities with cohort evidence when enough) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 214.67 Tm (comparable closed cases exist, while keeping unresolved cases visible to avoid survivorship bias.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 199.45 Tm (Assign a researcher to source acquisition and kinship evidence, an authorized reviewer to contract and entitlement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 184.22 Tm (questions, and a named operator to case spending and contact release. One person may fill several operational roles, but) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 169.00 Tm (the record should still show which decision was made and on what evidence. Review spending after the initial docket) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 153.77 Tm (review, after essential vital records arrive, and before expensive unresolved branches consume the remaining budget.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 138.55 Tm (Automation earns its place when it reduces duplicate retrieval, locates supporting pages faster, or exposes a weak case) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 123.32 Tm (earlier. Do not assume fewer transcription minutes automatically lower the sixty-hour budget. Measure actual time) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 108.10 Tm (saved, deduct review and correction time, and update future case estimates only when completed work supports the) Tj ET
